        "id": 20499,
        "name": "bluntaxe",
        "username": "bluntaxe",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/dbc845/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2021-01-11T15:20:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Cursed (Power source)<br>\n- Lets say I take Self Control (Absobtion) and signature Weaponry.<br>\n- Selecting two yellow abilities, attunement says [element/engery] so I can't select that since I didn't take an Element/Engery power?&nbsp; *(I'm basing this assumption from the statement on page 44 under Defining Abilities).</p>\n<p>Archtype (Physical Powerhouse)<br>\n- It says to take two abiliites using powers in the Physical Powerhouse as green abilities and one as a yellow.&nbsp; If you were only able to take two Physcial Powerhouse powers (because previous selection only had two dice granted).&nbsp; What happens with that 3rd yellow power?&nbsp; Don't take it?&nbsp; Assign it to a power outside of Physical Powerhouse?&nbsp; Assign it to a power that already has an ability?&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:54:37.354Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 22,
        "reads": 6,
        "readers_count": 5,
        "score": 111.2,
