        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Cursed (Power source)<br />\r\n- Lets say I take Self Control (Absobtion) and signature Weaponry.<br />\r\n- Selecting two yellow abilities, attunement says [element/engery] so I can't select that since I didn't take an Element/Engery power?&nbsp; *(I'm basing this assumption from the statement on page 44 under Defining Abilities).</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Archtype (Physical Powerhouse)<br />\r\n- It says to take two abiliites using powers in the Physical Powerhouse as green abilities and one as a yellow.&nbsp; If you were only able to take two Physcial Powerhouse powers (because previous selection only had two dice granted).&nbsp; What happens with that 3rd yellow power?&nbsp; Don't take it?&nbsp; Assign it to a power outside of Physical Powerhouse?&nbsp; Assign it to a power that already has an ability?&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
