        "id": 234674,
        "name": "Sonvar",
        "username": "Powerhound_2000",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-01-11T15:38:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Based on how it's written I'd say you can choose any power or quality that you have that was not used for the two green abilities. &nbsp;Optionally you could&nbsp;take Damage Resistance as your green or yellow ability which does leave you with being able to just use the two powers and/or qualities you picked up for Physical Powerhouse.&nbsp;</p>",
