        "id": 234675,
        "name": "MindWanderer",
        "username": "MindWanderer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-01-11T16:40:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Unlike some Archetypes, the Cursed power source doesn't restrict your choice to only powers that you chose or ones from a certain list.&nbsp; Nothing in \"Defining Abilities\" says your choices are limited this way.&nbsp; We do know that one of the SCRPG Season 2 heroes had Immunity from the Accident power source without having an Energy/Element power, although it's not phrased quite the same way.</p>\n<p>For Physical Powerhouse, indeed, the Yellow ability isn't restricted to a power or quality from the Physical Powerhouse list.</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:10:49.688Z",
