        "raw": "<p>Unlike some Archetypes, the Cursed power source doesn't restrict your choice to only powers that you chose or ones from a certain list.&nbsp; Nothing in \"Defining Abilities\" says your choices are limited this way.&nbsp; We do know that one of the SCRPG Season 2 heroes had Immunity from the Accident power source without having an Energy/Element power, although it's not phrased quite the same way.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For Physical Powerhouse, indeed, the Yellow ability isn't restricted to a power or quality from the Physical Powerhouse list.</p>",
